oppio, and Ristretto—culminating in a new hybrid architecture called Latte. Latte blends local fast storage with cloud persistence, using lightweight ML‑driven I/O scheduling and advanced cache management to reduce tail latency, increase elasticity, and improve reliability for cloud‑native and AI workloads."}, "settings": {}}